body:
@hkdobrev Using the `render` event you should be able to hide/show the pagination: https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/documentation/#events

I do not think we need any new API entry to deal with this case. Given your preference you might or might not want to hide the pagination.

Still, being able to use a function as for the autoHideContainer seems like a nice idea, can you draft a new issue about it? Much like the #817
